 8 |   1 + g(n + 1)
   |       ^^^^^^^^ this call of `f` takes a frame for every round
  = note: not the last thing `f` does, and `n + 1` is not a part of `n`
  = note: `g` is `f`: an alias is the function it names
  = help: carry the running value in a parameter, so that the call comes last
  = help: if its depth is bounded by something the compiler cannot see, write `deep fn f`
